Z||000000||JetroGT||10-31-2001||11:39 PM||||I was reading the post about Creed and I thought I would pull up some files... My mp3's are all gone! WTF! I have them all backed up on CD but still. How can that happen. Virus, hacker. Last night I was messing around with the leach FTP progam...<P>I'm logging off to back them up.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/NewSigt.jpg">   <BR>I work where all the missing paperclips go.||||reg||11
Z||000001||JetroGT||10-31-2001||11:56 PM||||Well, I guess I should have looked with the search function. Somehow the folder "My Music" got copied. And the real My Music folder somehow made it into the "My pictures" Folder. Is Windows ME supposed to suck this much? <P>I'm calmed down now. It's just I would have lost 500 or so files.||||reg||14
Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||11-01-2001||04:57 AM||||That sometimes happens in Explorer. You click a folder to open it, but while you click it you accidently move the mouse. Explorer then thinks you want to move the folder - usually to the folder directly above or below.||||reg||1
Z||000003||isthiswhereiputausername?||11-01-2001||12:43 PM||||I  lost a cd of good mp3 albums also.. worked fine last week when I was playing it,but tried it last night, wouldnt read most of the songs,  tried to test the cdr, had about 60 errors on it..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR>was a good quality cdr,no scratches, no dirt, was never dropped, was stored in the same place since it was burned..  never had a cd do that before..<P>Thats life I guess  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||SteveJ||11-01-2001||05:15 PM||||Ha, I had a good one. Our server had it's main database subdirectory deleted. Naturally we thought it was malicious and we had been attacked. I did a restore from backup and we went back into operation.<P>A week later I found the subdirectory where it had been moved to an obscure part of the directory structure. It must have been moved by the explorer by accident. <P>The worst part as I thought about it was that only I had enough rights to move it. - OOPS !||||reg||1
